an class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/ikonomika/struktura#sabitiya\">← <!-- -->Решения и събития</a></p><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">2007</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Членство в ЕС</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">България влиза в ЕС на 1 януари 2007 г. Отварят се пазарите и започват да идват евросредства.</div></div></div><section class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mb-12 max-w-5xl text-[15px]\"><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-1\">Какво последва</h3><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1\"><li>Свободно движение на хора: започва голяма вълна на емиграция.</li><li>Достъп до европейски фондове: вижте страницата за еврофондовете.</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Три години преди и три години след</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Средно за <!-- -->2004<!-- -->–<!-- -->2006<!-- --> г. срещу <!-- -->2007<!-- -->–<!-- -->2009<!-- --> г. Данните се обновяват сами с всяка нова година от Евростат. Съвпадението във времето не доказва, че събитието е причината.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-[15px] num\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-rule text-left\"><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Показател</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right\">Преди</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right\">След</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right\">Промяна</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">ЕС преди → след</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/gdp_growth\">Реален растеж на БВП</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">6,8%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">3,2%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-red\">-3,6</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">2,6 → -0,2</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/inflation\">Инфлация</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">6,5%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">7,4%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-red\">+0,9</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">2,4 → 2,3</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/unemployment\">Безработица</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">няма данни</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">няма данни</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">–</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/employment_rate\">Заетост (20–64 г.)</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">няма данни</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">няма данни</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">–</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/investment\">Инвестиции</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">24,7%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">29,7%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-[#2f9e6a]\">+5</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">22 → 22,5</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/exports\">Износ</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">43,5%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">49%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">+5,5</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">37,3 → 38,9</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/deficit\">Бюджетно салдо</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">2%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">-1%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-red\">-3</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">-2,2 → -2,9</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/debt\">Държавен дълг</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">27,7%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">14,3%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-[#2f9e6a]\">-13,4</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">66,4 → 67,7</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/gov_expenditure\">Държавни разходи</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">36,1%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">38%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">+2</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">47,1 → 47,9</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/ikonomika/investicii\">Нови чужди инвестиции</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">млн. €</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">няма данни</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">няма данни</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">–</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/house_prices\">Поскъпване на жилищата</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">няма данни</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">11,2%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">–</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/net_migration\">Нетна миграция</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">на 1000 души</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">-2,2</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">-2,4</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-red\">-0,2</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">3 → 2,2</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-2\">Зелено: промяната е към по-добро за хората, червено: към по-лошо. Сравнението с ЕС показва дали промяната е само у нас или навсякъде.</p></section><section class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 mb-12\"><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Реален растеж, %</h3><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Безработица, %</h3><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Инфлация, %</h3><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Държавен дълг, % от БВП</h3><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div></section><p class=\"text-[15px] flex justify-between gap-4\"><span><a href=\"/ikonomika/sabitie/valuten-bord\">← <!-- -->1997<!-- -->: <!-- -->Валутен борд</a></span><span><a href=\"/ikonomika/sabitie/ploskiat-danak\">2008<!-- -->: <!-- -->Плосък данък 10%<!-- --> →</a></span></p></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-surface border-t border-rule mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 text-sm text-muted grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><p>Не подкрепяме партия, кандидат или правителство. Всяко число има източник и дата.<!-- --> <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a> · <a href=\"/rechnik\">Речник</a> · <a href=\"/sastoyanie\">Състояние на данните</a> · <!--$?--><template id=\"B:1\"></template><a href=\"/metodologiya#greshki\">Съобщи за грешка</a><!--/$--></p><p class=\"sm:text-right\">Вътрешен прототип · данните са към датите, посочени до тях</p></div></footer><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script id=\"_R_\">(globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] || (globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] = [])).push({\"otherChunks\":[\"static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\",\"static/chunks/2vy51v46dlsq-.js\",\"static/chunks/2bx7ggprk0oi5.js\",\"static/chunks/0c1ad7rcpjghx.js\"],\"runtimeModuleIds\":[94553]});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><header class=\"bg-deep text-white border-b border-white/10 sticky top-0 z-40 lg:static\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 flex items-center gap-x-8 h-14 lg:h